{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_009_nnu_net-title\">nnU-Net</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">dataset fingerprint 驱动的自配置、交叉验证与推理后处理闭环，而不是单一新算子。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Dataset-fingerprint-driven self-configuration, 5-fold cross-validation ensembling, and post-processing loop rather than a new neural block.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">带影像、标签与 spacing 元数据的新分割数据集</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">New medical segmentation dataset with raw images, masks, and physical voxel spacing metadata</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">经交叉验证选择和后处理的可复现分割系统</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Self-configured, cross-validated, and post-processed end-to-end segmentation system</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-020-01008-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_009_nnu_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_009_nnu_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"nnU-Net original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6cc1dd0b5fc97779ac41.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_009_nnu_net\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_009_nnu_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_009_nnu_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">原始数据集</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">影像、标签、模态、尺寸与物理 spacing 构成配置输入。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests new medical segmentation dataset with raw images, masks, and physical voxel spacing metadata and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"影像、标签、模态、尺寸与物理 spacing 构成配置输入。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests new medical segmentation dataset with raw images, masks, and physical voxel spacing metadata and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"原始数据集\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原始数据集</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">影像、标签、模态、尺寸与物理 spacing 构成配置输入。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests new medical segmentation dataset with raw images, masks, and physical voxel spacing metadata and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"统计强度、形状、spacing、类别与病例规模。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Dataset Fingerprint to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Dataset Fingerprint\" data-node-name-en=\"Dataset Fingerprint\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Dataset Fingerprint</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">统计强度、形状、spacing、类别与病例规模。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Dataset Fingerprint to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按显存预算推导 target spacing、patch、batch、kernel 和 pooling。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Experiment Planner within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Experiment Planner\" data-node-name-en=\"Experiment Planner\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Experiment Planner</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按显存预算推导 target spacing、patch、batch、kernel 和 pooling。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Experiment Planner within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"生成适用的 2D、3D full-resolution 与低分辨率级联配置。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D/3D/Cascade within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"2D/3D/Cascade\" data-node-name-en=\"2D/3D/Cascade\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>2D/3D/Cascade</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">生成适用的 2D、3D full-resolution 与低分辨率级联配置。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D/3D/Cascade within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重采样、裁剪、归一化并缓存可复现实验输入。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"预处理\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预处理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重采样、裁剪、归一化并缓存可复现实验输入。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CE+Dice、foreground sampling、深监督和强增强构成统一 recipe。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs U-Net training within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"U-Net 训练\" data-node-name-en=\"U-Net training\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">U-Net 训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">U-Net training</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CE+Dice、foreground sampling、深监督和强增强构成统一 recipe。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs U-Net training within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各配置交叉验证并保存 fold 模型与 out-of-fold 预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 5-fold CV within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"5-fold CV\" data-node-name-en=\"5-fold CV\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>5-fold CV</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各配置交叉验证并保存 fold 模型与 out-of-fold 预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 5-fold CV within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重叠滑窗、Gaussian weighting 与镜像 TTA 生成全体预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs + TTA within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"滑窗 + TTA\" data-node-name-en=\"+ TTA\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">滑窗 + TTA</span><span class=\"lang-en\">+ TTA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重叠滑窗、Gaussian weighting 与镜像 TTA 生成全体预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs + TTA within the core self configuring pipeline computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅在交叉验证证实有益时采用连通域等后处理和 ensemble。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"后处理选择\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">后处理选择</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅在交叉验证证实有益时采用连通域等后处理和 ensemble。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出配置、权重、预测与完整可复现 pipeline。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces self-configured, cross-validated, and post-processed end-to-end segmentation system via Final Segmentation.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"最终分割\" data-node-name-en=\"Final Segmentation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_009_nnu_net', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">最终分割</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Final Segmentation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出配置、权重、预测与完整可复现 pipeline。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces self-configured, cross-validated, and post-processed end-to-end segmentation system via Final Segmentation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"nnU-Net Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 数据指纹驱动配置并集成五折预测</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Dataset-Fingerprint Rule Engine &amp; 5-Fold Sliding-Window Ensemble</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"nnU-Net：核心公式 · 数据指纹驱动配置并集成五折预测\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"9\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.897727pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.752298 -67.992624 248.113688 28.897727\" width=\"248.113688pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m009_g29-49\"></path><path d=\"M3.173555-4.934226L3.108345-4.984945C2.999662-4.832788 2.927206-4.79656 2.775049-4.79656H1.260727L.470961-3.079363C.463716-3.064872 .463716-3.043135 .463716-3.043135C.463716-3.006907 .492698-2.98517 .550663-2.98517C.78252-2.98517 1.072343-2.934452 1.369411-2.840259C2.20265-2.572174 2.586665-2.122949 2.586665-1.405639C2.586665-.710065 2.144686-.166648 1.579532-.166648C1.434621-.166648 1.311446-.217367 1.094079-.376769C.862222-.543417 .695574-.615873 .543417-.615873C.333296-.615873 .231858-.528926 .231858-.347787C.231858-.072456 .572399 .101438 1.115816 .101438C1.72444