><use x=\"54.200357\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g16-186\" y=\"-50.835855\"></use><use x=\"59.676391\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g25-150\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"86.462539\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g32-94\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"84.589577\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g25-63\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"90.467527\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g16-185\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"94.263292\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g25-69\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"99.135017\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g16-186\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"105.718025\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g4-61\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"116.017107\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g32-49\" y=\"-57.565608\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"4.98132\" x=\"116.017107\" y=\"-53.660255\"></rect><use x=\"116.017107\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g32-53\" y=\"-43.986555\"></use><use x=\"128.626454\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g29-53\" y=\"-63.007679\"></use><use x=\"123.85434\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g7-213\" y=\"-61.015166\"></use><use x=\"124.479189\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g22-58\" y=\"-39.174598\"></use><use x=\"128.475542\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g1-61\" y=\"-39.174598\"></use><use x=\"133.100996\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g29-49\" y=\"-39.174598\"></use><use x=\"140.428806\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g25-53\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"143.988959\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g22-92\" y=\"-49.326531\"></use><use x=\"147.806446\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g19-58\" y=\"-48.193724\"></use><use x=\"151.781534\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g22-150\" y=\"-49.326531\"></use><use x=\"154.886983\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g22-99\" y=\"-49.326531\"></use><use x=\"159.508796\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g10-3\" y=\"-51.428344\"></use><use x=\"163.583992\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g16-185\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"167.300052\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g25-71\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"172.206634\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g16-186\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"175.905259\" xlink:href=\"#m009_g22-69\" y=\"-49.326531\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">新数据集依赖大量专家手调，论文比较常被 pipeline 差异混淆</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Segmentation performance was dominated by manual per-dataset tuning, confounding architectural comparisons across papers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">根据数据集 fingerprint 自动配置预处理、网络、采样、训练与推理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Automate preprocessing, network topology, patch/batch sizing, sampling, training schedule, and post-processing directly from dataset statistics.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">规则与经验结合选择 spacing、patch/batch、2D/3D/cascade、增强和后处理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Couples rule-based domain heuristics (spacing, anisotropy, modality normalization) with empirical cross-validation model selection.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在多器官、多模态分割中成为统一、可复现的基础设施</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Serves as the undisputed reproducible infrastructure across multi-organ and multi-modality medical segmentation benchmarks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在适用的数据与任务设置下，是新分割方法应比较的必做基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Mandatory first-line baseline against which any newly proposed segmentation architecture must be benchmarked.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">模型配置由数据集 fingerprint 和显存约束推导，而非固定网络图。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">把预处理、采样、增强、loss、推理和后处理纳入同一可复现对象。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">通过交叉验证选择配置与后处理，减少单次 split 和手工调参偏差。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Automate preprocessing, network topology, patch/batch sizing, sampling, training schedule, and post-processing directly from dataset statistics.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Couples rule-based domain heuristics (spacing, anisotropy, modality normalization) with empirical cross-validation model selection.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Dataset-Fingerprint Rule Engine &amp; 5-Fold Sliding-Window Ensemble.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">它是大多数新医学分割方法应在相同数据条件下比较的系统级强基线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">其优势不能被简单归因于 U-Net block；公平消融必须锁定完整 pipeline。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Serves as the undisputed reproducible infrastructure across multi-organ and multi-modality medical segmentation benchmarks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Mandatory first-line baseline against which any newly proposed segmentation architecture must be benchmarked.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-020-01008-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>nnU-Net: a self-configuring method for deep learning-based biomedical image segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnUNet\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}